#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client so you can run jobs on IBM quantum "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Instalează clientul Qiskit Runtime pentru a putea rula joburi pe "
"calculatoare cuantice IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client"
msgstr "Instalarea clientului Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"
msgstr ""
"Instalarea clientului Qiskit Runtime {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations"
" on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing the Qiskit Runtime "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime este serviciul bazat pe cloud pentru executarea calculelor "
"cuantice pe hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. Acest ghid îți arată cum să instalezi"
" `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, care este pachetul client pentru accesarea "
"serviciului Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before installing the Qiskit Runtime client, follow the instructions in "
"these guides:\n"
msgstr ""
"Înainte de a instala clientul Qiskit Runtime, urmează instrucțiunile din "
"aceste ghiduri:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instalare Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configurare cont IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Rulează această comandă pentru a instala Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Rămâi la curent cu cele mai recente versiuni\">\n"
"Verifică periodic [notele de lansare Qiskit Runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) pentru a vedea noile versiuni. Recomandăm actualizarea frecventă a cerințelor pentru `qiskit-ibm-runtime` prin rularea `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Pașii următori {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomandări\">\n"
"  - [Instalează Qiskit SDK din sursă](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Rulează primul tău program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Încearcă un tutorial, cum ar fi [Algoritmul lui Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Consultă [politica de deprecare](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
